<title>UK: PolyGram, Alan Parker in Dirty Hands deal.</title>
<headline>PolyGram, Alan Parker in Dirty Hands deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>PolyGram NV's Filmed Entertainment unit said on Wednesday it formed a partnership with British director Alan Parker and his Dirty Hands Productions company.</p>
<p>PolyGram said it expected to finance and distribute one or two films a year produced by Dirty Hands, which will be based in Los Angeles and London.</p>
<p>In addition, PolyGram will take a minority stake in Dirty Hands Media Co, which will produce music and television, among other things.</p>
<p>Parker's box-office successes include 'Evita', Pink Floyd's 'The Wall'; 'Angel Heart' and 'The Commitments'.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
